            <div class="section-title">RESOLUTION</div>
            <div class="content-block">
                The one meter focal length monochromator associated with the high density holographic grating and advanced PMT detection offers the best resolution achievable. Less than 5 picometers are achieved in the 160-320 nm range and less than 10 picometers in the 320-800 nm range. Resolution shortens the time needed for method development, even for difficult matrices.
