            <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">User oriented design for ease of use and high technology for unrivaled performance</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="section-title">Analyst Software</div>
    <div class="content-block" style="font-size: 12pt;">
        Analyst software extends instrument capability and ensures traceability.
    </div>

    <div class="two-column" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <div class="column">
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li>Analyst provides a data audit trail for users and instrument operation. 21 CFR Part 11 compliance is obtained through a powerful SQL Server database ensuring integrity of raw data and traceability of operations.</li>
                <li>User rights management is available for enhanced security and management of access levels for each analyst.</li>
                <li>Automatic start up and shutdown afford flexibility of use and reduces argon usage.</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="image-placeholder" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                <!-- Placeholder for Software Screenshot 1 -->
                <div style="width: 100%; height: 150px; border: 1px solid #ccc; background-color: #f0f0f0;"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="column">
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li>Enhanced productivity with automated analysis thanks to multiple methods sequence, programmable recalibration and automated QC checks with user defined actions, in combination with the autosampler.</li>
                <li>Import and export of data from LIMS with a large variety of report and exports formats for results.</li>
                <li>Semi-quantitative analysis using full spectrum acquisition and Image Navigator.</li>
                <li>Statistical Process Control included for X, R, SD and histogram charts for user-selected samples.</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="image-placeholder" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                <!-- Placeholder for Software Screenshot 2 -->
